    "Check for deletion protection flags where applicable (DynamoDB table deletion protection, CloudFormation stack termination protection, S3 MFA delete or bucket policies preventing deletion)",
    "Note whether the stack is a single region deployment with no DR setup, or whether any partial protections exist",
    "Summarize concrete gaps found (e.g., 'no PITR on table X', 'no cross-region replica', 'no deletion protection')"
  ]
}", "deep_research": false}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Survey booking-api CloudFormation stack in eu-west-1 for DR and backup posture"}], "created_at": null}

